  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into large chunks and place on a lined oven tray.\n• Add brown mustard seeds and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80a535963fcd98f40a94/step-562ff800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Roughly chop coriander.\n• Cut firm tofu into 1cm chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine the plain flour, Mumbai spice blend and tofu.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80a535963fcd98f40a94/step-56ddba10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• Add baby spinach leaves, carrot and snacking tomatoes. Toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80a535963fcd98f40a94/step-ab8a0720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Transfer to a plate to rest.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80a535963fcd98f40a94/step-a33d2f30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add Mumbai spice blend and garlic and cook, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir through coconut milk and simmer until thickened slightly, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste.\n• Once sweet potatoes are done, add coriander to the tray and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80a535963fcd98f40a94/step-eb894a40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tofu, spiced sweet potatoes and salad between plates.\n• Pour the fragrant coconut sauce over the tofu to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80a535963fcd98f40a94/step-e6a2b850.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
